# Bolt Bend's discount at exactly power 4: Bot1's Giant Cindermaw is a 4/3, so Bolt Bend costs {R} and tapping Mox Ruby #2
# alone pays for it (it would be refused for want of mana otherwise). Rulings 2024-11-08: once cast, losing the creature
# does not change the cost or the spell. Bot2's Lightning Bolt targets the Cindermaw; Bot1 casts Bolt Bend; Bot2 responds
# with Bovine Intervention and destroys the Cindermaw (Bot1 gets an Ox). Bolt Bend then resolves anyway: the Bolt's own
# target is gone, which does not matter, and Bot1, asked, picks Bot2 for the new target. Bot2 17; Bot1 stays at 20.

